()" style="margin-left:auto;padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px;background:#4b2428;color:#ff9b98;border:0;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer">关闭</button></div><div class="asset-grid" id="assetGrid"></div></div></div><script>
